{"goals":["∀ (a : ℕ) (p : ℝ),\n  UniversalLaw.Spec.P15.binomTail (2 * a + 3) (a + 1) p - UniversalLaw.Spec.P15.binomTail (2 * a + 1) a p =\n      (1 - p) ^ 2 * (↑((2 * a + 1).choose (a + 1)) * p ^ (a + 1) * (1 - p) ^ a) -\n        p ^ 2 * (↑((2 * a + 1).choose a) * p ^ a * (1 - p) ^ (a + 1)) ∧\n    UniversalLaw.Spec.P15.binomTail (2 * a + 3) (a + 1) p - UniversalLaw.Spec.P15.binomTail (2 * a + 1) a p =\n        p * (1 - 2 * p) * (↑((2 * a + 1).choose a) * p ^ a * (1 - p) ^ (a + 1)) ∧\n      (1 / 2 < p →\n        p < 1 →\n          UniversalLaw.Spec.P15.binomTail (2 * a + 3) (a + 1) p - UniversalLaw.Spec.P15.binomTail (2 * a + 1) a p < 0)"],"id":165,"ok":true,"protocol":"ul-closed-proof-v1","session":"cf0653d97db44b30903abd8a2f766efc","state":41,"status":"opened","task":"p15.OddMajorityIdentity"}
